# Customer Churn Prediction Model

*"Predicted customer churn with 67.56% of PR-AUC using CatBoost, identifying key retention drivers for a telecom dataset."*.

## Key Results & Business Impact
- **Model Performance:** Achieved **0.67 PR-AUC**  outperforming the baseline logistic regression model by 3%.
- **Top Insights:** Identified that month-to-month contracts and dependents were the strongest predictors of churn using SHAP analysis.
- **Actionable Recommendation:** Targeting the top 20% highest-risk customers with retention offers could save the customers.

