## How to Reproduce
1. **Clone the repository:**
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com
   cd your-repo-name
   ```
2. **Create a virtual environment and install dependencies:**
   ```bash
   python -m venv venv
   source venv/bin/activate  # On Windows: venv\Scripts\activate
   pip install -r requirements.txt
   ```
3. **Run the pipeline:**
   ```bash
   python src/train.py
   ```

